# No code comments

- Do not add comments, doc comments (`///`), or explanatory inline comments to source files.
- Prefer clear names and structure over comments.
- Do not leave TODO/FIXME/NOTE comments unless the user explicitly asks for them.
- When editing existing files, do not introduce new comments. Leave pre-existing comments untouched unless the user asks to remove them.
